  "method": {
    "title": "AZTEC translational biomarkers: reproduction",
    "question": "Do Figures 3 and 4 and Supplementary Figures S4 and S5 of the AZTEC trial (Nat Commun 2026, 10.1038/s41467-026-75660-y) regenerate from the deposited Rmd and source data (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.20345790)?",
    "findings": [
      "Figure 3, the TILs ROC and the logistic model reproduce exactly from the deposited Rmd and source data",
      "Figure 4 and S5 differ: the deposited data give 42 Cycle 1 patients in the clinical-benefit set, the authors' rendering shows 43, so every Cycle 1 p-value shifts"
    ]
  },
